[00:18.467]You're just a picture on a screen
{"你只是屏幕上的一个画面"}
[00:22.382]Tell me are you real or just a dream
{"告诉我你是真实存在还是梦境一场"}
[00:26.570]Most beautiful smile I've never seen
{"我从未见过如此美丽的微笑"}
[00:30.785]I wanna take you everywhere with me
{"我想带你去往每个地方"}
[00:36.579]Can I get lost inside your dark brown eyes
{"能否迷失在你深邃的棕眸里"}
[00:41.771]I just can't wait anymore
{"我已无法继续等待"}
[00:45.631]The distance is fine
{"距离不是问题"}
[00:47.831]I'll buy a flight
{"我会买张机票"}
[00:50.771]Just to be at your door
{"只为抵达你家门前"}
[00:55.439]Two thousand seven hundred and twenty five
{"两千七百二十五"}
[00:58.925]That's how many miles
{"这就是相隔的英里数"}
[01:01.743]Your bed is from mine
{"你的床与我的距离"}
[01:03.291]Don't wanna overthink it
{"不愿过度思考"}
[01:06.081]I do every time
{"却每次都陷入纠结"}
[01:08.331]'Cause this is so nice
{"因为这感觉太美妙"}
[01:12.486]Don't know where it's headed
{"不知它将通向何方"}
[01:14.873]We're going in blind
{"我们盲目前行"}
[01:16.604]In 24 hours
{"二十四小时之内"}
[01:19.180]Had me losing my mind
{"就让我彻底沦陷"}
[01:21.332]I was rushing in y'said we got time
{"我急切奔赴你说我们还有时间"}
[01:25.784]This is so nice
{"这感觉太美妙"}
[01:29.171]I love that you can play guitar
{"我爱你会弹吉他"}
[01:33.145]But can you hold me in your arms
{"但能否将我拥入怀中"}
[01:37.764]We can listen to The Cure
{"我们可以听着治疗乐队"}
[01:41.492]I'll tell you all my secrets on your floor
